  { number := 206, text := "### 0.1.0 - 20261024" },
  { number := 207, text := "" },
  { number := 208, text := "First publication of the session bus as numbered specification 0015 with file name `0015_Session_Bus.md`. Records attach to a text user interface session that is already running, a local socket at `$XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/grok-oss/<session>.sock` with mode `0600` and the same user id only, no network listener, client `grok-oss bus` over `stdio` with `TOON` in both directions, and `grok-oss mcp-serve bus` for the same methods. Records methods `sessions`, `look`, `transcript`, `owns`, `interject`, `queue`, `approve`, `deny`, and `subscribe`. Records `approve` and `deny` off by default, transcript deltas only, an 80 character cap on `look` fields, attribution `[bus: <client>]`, and that the bus does not kill a session. Records that remote access, replacing `ACP`, and outside changes to permissions or configuration are out of scope. Records that a conforming session bus program is not claimed. The source draft is `/home/hunter/0_session_bus_toon.md`." },
